+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+/* The Mega Evolution effect: the scene dims, lights of every colour gather */
+/* round the Pokémon, a ring of light closes over it as it turns white,     */
+/* then it bursts into shards and stands in its new form. The sprites are   */
+/* the port's own, drawn by tools/dev/mega_fx.py.                           */
+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+
